WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.302 --> 00:00:06.364
As soon as the prison guard returned, the servant from Hendon Manor had to leave

2
00:00:06.365 --> 00:00:17.778
the jail cell. But before leaving, Andrews pledged his loyalty to Miles again, saying he

3
00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:24.953
would do whatever was necessary to restore Miles to his rightful place within his family.

4
00:00:24.954 --> 00:00:32.445
"Thank goodness for Andrews! I am relieved to know that I am not crazy," Miles

5
00:00:32.446 --> 00:00:40.090
told Edward. "I never doubted you," Edward reassured him. "Do you doubt me when I

6
00:00:40.091 --> 00:00:49.495
remind you that I am the king of England?" Miles hesitated. He did not want

7
00:00:49.496 --> 00:00:54.931
to lie to Edward, but he didn't want to distress the boy with the truth either.

8
00:00:54.932 --> 00:01:00.164
Luckily the prison guard brought food just then—moldy bread and bowls of watery, cold soup,

9
00:01:00.165 --> 00:01:06.743
which he left on the floor. The prisoners scrambled to grab some food, as far

10
00:01:06.744 --> 00:01:14.410
as their chains would allow them. The guard laughed cruelly. Then he slammed the door

11
00:01:14.411 --> 00:01:19.394
and locked it. Miles lunged for some food for Edward and himself. But he couldn't

12
00:01:19.395 --> 00:01:26.385
reach it before it was all gone. "I'm sorry, Your Majesty," he apologized. "I was

13
00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:33.869
not quick enough. Now you will go hungry." "Here, why don't you take this?" said

14
00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:41.058
the woman who had hugged Edward. She could hear the young boy's stomach growling with

15
00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:46.286
hunger. She leaned over and gave him her piece of bread. The other woman held

16
00:01:46.287 --> 00:01:53.048
out a bowl with a few drops of soup left. "You can swallow the bread

17
00:01:53.049 --> 00:02:01.191
with this." Edward's eyes suddenly burned. He felt deeply moved and grateful as he took

18
00:02:01.192 --> 00:02:10.462
the food from the women. They smiled as he gulped down the scrap of bread

19
00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:15.103
and sipped the soup. Then Edward curled into a ball and lay down. The women

20
00:02:15.104 --> 00:02:17.684
sang until he fell asleep. The next morning when Edward awoke, he saw Miles leaning against

21
00:02:17.685 --> 00:02:22.332
the wall of the jail cell, his head in his hands. "Miles?" Edward called. Miles

22
00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:29.849
looked up with bloodshot eyes. Now Edward could see that the jail cell was less

23
00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:32.929
crowded. Edward sat up. "Where are the two women who sang to me last night?"

24
00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:38.404
Miles shook his head sadly. Edward's heart skipped a beat. "Answer me!" he pleaded. "At

25
00:02:38.405 --> 00:02:47.062
dawn the guards came to take away some prisoners." He paused. "Including the two women."

26
00:02:47.063 --> 00:02:51.330
"Where did they take them?" demanded Edward. "Outside, Your Majesty," Miles said quietly. "To be

27
00:02:51.331 --> 00:02:53.906
executed." "What?" Edward was stunned. "But . . . but their crimes were minor! How

28
00:02:53.907 --> 00:03:06.818
could the punishment be execution?" "It is the law of England," Miles informed him woodenly.

29
00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:12.872
Edward collapsed to the floor. "How could the law be so inhumane? Those women were

30
00:03:12.873 --> 00:03:25.215
so gentle and kind. They did not deserve this." Edward began to cry. He couldn't

31
00:03:25.216 --> 00:03:32.461
help it. "Please, Your Majesty, there is nothing you could have done," said Miles. "You

32
00:03:32.462 --> 00:03:38.047
may be right. But there is something I can do later! And I promise you,

33
00:03:38.048 --> 00:03:49.867
Sir Miles, England's laws will change. You have my word as king!" At that moment the

34
00:03:49.868 --> 00:03:53.772
prison door swung open, and the guard came in to collect Miles and Edward. "It's

35
00:03:53.773 --> 00:03:57.605
your lucky day," the guard sneered. He set Edward free. "The benevolent Lord Hendon has

36
00:03:57.606 --> 00:04:02.190
dropped the charges against you. But you," he added, turning to Miles, "you'll receive punishment

37
00:04:02.191 --> 00:04:07.262
that fits your crime." "What will you do to him? Tell me!" Edward cried. The

38
00:04:07.263 --> 00:04:17.246
guard pushed him aside and unchained Miles. Edward's panic was mounting. "Where are you taking

39
00:04:17.247 --> 00:04:23.341
him?" "It's nothing to you, boy! You're free now. Scram!" The guard dragged Miles outside

40
00:04:23.342 --> 00:04:31.082
to a low wooden stand and forced him to sit with his feet thrust through

41
00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:33.574
cut-out holes. A crowd quickly gathered. They taunted the prisoner and threw things at him.

42
00:04:33.575 --> 00:04:37.738
Others spat at poor Miles. Edward stood in front of his friend, trying to shield

43
00:04:37.739 --> 00:04:40.730
him. "Stop it! I order you to stop it!" People began shouting at Edward. "Move

44
00:04:40.731 --> 00:04:46.741
away!" "Get lost!" They began throwing things at him too. Suddenly the crowd parted, and

45
00:04:46.742 --> 00:04:56.876
Miles' brother, Hugh, appeared on a horse. "Have you no appreciation, boy?" Hugh pointed a whip

46
00:04:56.877 --> 00:05:06.547
at Edward. "That man is getting what he deserves. Move out of the way!" Edward

47
00:05:06.548 --> 00:05:16.786
glared at Hugh. "No! You are a disgusting liar! You are going to pay for

48
00:05:16.787 --> 00:05:20.516
what you did to Miles!" Hugh narrowed his eyes and then tossed the whip toward

49
00:05:20.517 --> 00:05:31.006
the prison guard. "Whip this insolent boy. Teach him some manners!" The guard snickered as

50
00:05:31.007 --> 00:05:36.363
two men grabbed Edward. "Let me go! How dare you handle the king of England

51
00:05:36.364 --> 00:05:40.852
this way!" Edward shouted. The crowd cheered as the men ripped off Edward's shirt. "Wait!"

52
00:05:40.853 --> 00:05:48.272
Miles cried. These men were heartless! "Why?" Hugh gazed at Miles with disdain. "Let the

53
00:05:48.273 --> 00:05:52.259
